<view class="heart-page"><view class="heading">让同校同学认识你</view><view class="muted">只填写你愿意分享的内容，不要填写电话、微信号或其他联系方式。</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="notice">{{error}}</view><view class="card">
<view>公开照片 · 1至3张（点击可移除）</view><image wx:for="{{photos}}" wx:key="*this" class="thumb" src="{{item}}" mode="aspectFill" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="remove"/><button wx:if="{{photos.length<3}}" bindtap="photos" disabled="{{busy}}">上传照片</button>
<view>我主动填写的性别</view><picker range="{{genders}}" value="{{genderIndex}}" bindchange="gender">{{genders[genderIndex]}}</picker><view>我希望认识</view><checkbox-group bindchange="preferences"><label><checkbox value="male" checked="{{maleSelected}}"/>男生</label><label><checkbox value="female" checked="{{femaleSelected}}"/>女生</label><label><checkbox value="other" checked="{{otherSelected}}"/>其他</label></checkbox-group>
<input placeholder="年级（如大二）" value="{{grade}}" data-field="grade" bindinput="input" maxlength="16"/><input placeholder="兴趣，以顿号分隔，如摄影、羽毛球" value="{{interests}}" data-field="interests" bindinput="input" maxlength="120"/><textarea placeholder="一句话介绍自己" value="{{bio}}" data-field="bio" bindinput="input" maxlength="160"/><input placeholder="最近想做什么 / 希望认识怎样的人" value="{{lookingFor}}" data-field="lookingFor" bindinput="input" maxlength="80"/>
<checkbox-group bindchange="consent"><label class="checks"><checkbox value="adult" checked="{{adultDeclared}}"/>我已年满18周岁，理解这是本人声明</label><label class="checks"><checkbox value="enabled" checked="{{enabled}}"/>主动开启心动模式，同意资料向符合条件的同校用户推荐</label><label class="checks"><checkbox value="fate" checked="{{allowFateCard}}"/>允许我的卡片出现在缘分卡推荐中（可选）</label></checkbox-group><view class="muted">尊重他人意愿；双方感兴趣后方可发起心动私聊。可随时退出，停止新的推荐曝光。其他校园功能不受影响。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="save" disabled="{{busy}}">保存并开启</button></view></view>
